---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../assets/megan.jpeg';
---

<BaseLayout title="Megan Lange">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-top">
      <div class="hero-id">
        <h1 class="name">Megan <span class="surname">Lange</span></h1>
        <p class="lede">Product manager. Platform builder. Compulsive shipper.</p>
        <p class="tagline">senior product leader &middot; commerce platforms &middot; subscriptions &middot; gaming &middot; AI tooling</p>
      </div>
      <Image
        class="portrait"
        src={portrait}
        alt="Megan Lange"
        width={440}
        densities={[1, 2]}
        loading="eager"
      />
    </div>

    <p>
      12+ years building commerce platform capabilities and experiences across Xbox, Microsoft
      365, and Windows devices &mdash; spanning core purchase, checkout, subscriptions, partner
      channels, and regulated payments.
    </p>
    <p>
      I took a device-bundling program its biggest OEMs had written off and grew it into a $98M
      business and a strategic consumer platform capability. I delivered the platform side of
      Rockstar&rsquo;s GTA VI pre-order launch across 20+ countries. And most recently I
      redesigned how money moves through the consumer platform end to end, in support of
      changing payment service regulations.
    </p>
    <p>
      Earlier at Microsoft I turned self-serve cancellation into a retention channel, lifted
      signup conversion on Teams, and built event and notification systems still leveraged
      across both the consumer and commercial platforms today. Before Microsoft, I gave a
      health-tech startup its first product management function and took a clinical-research
      platform from concept through launch.
    </p>
    <p>
      Now I build the AI tooling my teammates adopt into daily use &mdash; shared Copilot CLI
      skills and agentic workflows that cut ~14 hours of recurring weekly work across my team.
    </p>
    <p class="block-label">what I&rsquo;m drawn to</p>
    <p class="blurb status">
      Senior product roles where the problem is genuinely hard and the domain is new to me.
    </p>

    <nav class="cta">
      <a href="/about/">about</a>
      <a href="/projects/">projects</a>
      <a href="/writing/">writing</a>
    </nav>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
  }
  .hero-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
  .hero-id {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .portrait {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 50% 15%;
    border: 3px solid var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 36px var(--accent-glow);
  }
  .name {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }
  .surname {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.4vw, 1.4rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm);
  }
  .tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .block-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin: var(--space-lg) 0 var(--space-xs);
  }
  .blurb {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  /* Closing block, set apart from the blocks above it */
  .status {
    padding-top: var(--space-md);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .status + .cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
  }
  .cta a {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
  }
  .cta a:hover,
  .cta a:focus-visible {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero-top {
      flex-direction: column-reverse;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }
    .portrait {
      width: 140px;
      height: 140px;
    }
  }
</style>
